Q: Change paper size in microsoft report viewer A: <p><em>You can use installed paper size's in your system</em></p>
<pre><code>PageSettings a4 = new PageSettings();
foreach (PaperSize item in a4.PrinterSettings.PaperSizes)
{
    if (item.PaperName == &quot;A4&quot;)
    {
        a4.PaperSize = item;
        break;
    }
}
</code></pre>
<p>Here is this which provide you paper size name and their size's
<a href="https://i.sstatic.net/E3Qsj.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer">check this image for clear understanding</a></p>

